{"name":"LangState.md","path":"typedoc/core/store/state/interfaces/LangState.md","format":"markdown","html":"<article class=\"docs-md\"><p><a href=\"../../../../README.md\"><strong>luiskr.com</strong></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"../../../../README.md\">luiskr.com</a> / <a href=\"../README.md\">core/store/state</a> / LangState</p>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/store/state.ts#L35\">core/store/state.ts:35</a></p>\n<p>The locale slice of StoreState: fetched dictionary nodes (components,\napp, slugs) plus the DB path grammar and resolved locale code.\n<code>components</code>/<code>app</code>/<code>slugs</code> are false/null until the Firebase fetch lands —\nreaders must treat falsy as &quot;load pending&quot;, never as &quot;empty&quot;.</p>\n<h2 id=\"properties\">Properties</h2>\n<h3 id=\"components\">components</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">components: unknown;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/store/state.ts#L36\">core/store/state.ts:36</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"app\">app</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">app: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt; | null;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/store/state.ts#L37\">core/store/state.ts:37</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"slugs\">slugs</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">slugs: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt; | null;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/core/store/state.ts#L38\">core/store/state.ts:38</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"carousel\">carousel</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">carousel: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Defined in: <a href=\"https://github.com/LuisKrotz/luiskr.com-V3/blob/9eeffce09b8f1b5d7b918bf7a393a7229dd71a78/